254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 108 0 R
/T (Incoming data is separated by its nature. Live signals pass through a streaming ingestion layer that handles a constant flow of small events. Imagery and map files are loaded in batches into large distributed object storage, where files are replicated across machines so that the loss of a single disk or server does not lose data. Geographic information is held in spatial databases and indexed by area, so that a request for one neighbourhood can be answered without scanning the world. Map data is served in small square tiles at different zoom levels, so a phone downloads only what it needs for the current view. Historical traffic is archived because patterns repeat by hour and day of week, and that history later improves predictions.)
/E (Incoming data is separated by its nature. Live signals pass through a streaming ingestion layer that handles a constant flow of small events. Imagery and map files are loaded in batches into large distributed object storage, where files are replicated across machines so that the loss of a single disk or server does not lose data. Geographic information is held in spatial databases and indexed by area, so that a request for one neighbourhood can be answered without scanning the world. Map data is served in small square tiles at different zoom levels, so a phone downloads only what it needs for the current view. Historical traffic is archived because patterns repeat by hour and day of week, and that history later improves predictions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 108 0 R
/T (thebasepictureof land, buildings, and roads. Camerason vehiclesand on portableequipmentcapture street-level imagery for Street View. Authoritative datasets from governments, transport agencies, and commercial providers supply road networks, speed limits, addresses, and public-transport timetables; the common timetable format used by transit agencies, GTFS, was in fact created by Google together with a transit agency. Business owners and ordinary users add place names, opening hours, photographs, reviews, and corrections.)
/E (thebasepictureof land, buildings, and roads. Camerason vehiclesand on portableequipmentcapture street-level imagery for Street View. Authoritative datasets from governments, transport agencies, and commercial providers supply road networks, speed limits, addresses, and public-transport timetables; the common timetable format used by transit agencies, GTFS, was in fact created by Google together with a transit agency. Business owners and ordinary users add place names, opening hours, photographs, reviews, and corrections.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
