<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 115 0 R
/T (Because validation could not separate the models, the group chose logistic regression, preferring the simplest model that gives class probabilities. This choice was made before looking at test results, and it was not changed afterwards. The decision tree scored one more correct test sample, but a difference of one sample out of 30 is within chance variation and switching to it after seeing the test set would turn the test set into a second validation set, defeating its purpose.)
/E (Because validation could not separate the models, the group chose logistic regression, preferring the simplest model that gives class probabilities. This choice was made before looking at test results, and it was not changed afterwards. The decision tree scored one more correct test sample, but a difference of one sample out of 30 is within chance variation and switching to it after seeing the test set would turn the test set into a second validation set, defeating its purpose.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
