/S /H2
/P 116 0 R
/T (The process flow shows that machine learning is a disciplined workflow: define the problem, understand and split the data, choose candidate algorithms, validate them honestly, test once, evaluate in detail, and keep monitoring after deployment. On the Iris project all three models performed similarly, and the decision between them was made on principle and not by selecting the best-looking test number. The next module opens the training step and shows, with explicit arithmetic, how a neural network learns its weights.)
/E (The process flow shows that machine learning is a disciplined workflow: define the problem, understand and split the data, choose candidate algorithms, validate them honestly, test once, evaluate in detail, and keep monitoring after deployment. On the Iris project all three models performed similarly, and the decision between them was made on principle and not by selecting the best-looking test number. The next module opens the training step and shows, with explicit arithmetic, how a neural network learns its weights.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
