/P 120 0 R
/T (In conclusion, backpropagation is the chain rule applied systematically: a forward pass to measure the error, a backward pass to share the blame among the weights, and an update to reduce the error. The following module uses a trained model of a different kind, a conversation system, and examines its logic and limits.)
/E (In conclusion, backpropagation is the chain rule applied systematically: a forward pass to measure the error, a backward pass to share the blame among the weights, and an update to reduce the error. The following module uses a trained model of a different kind, a conversation system, and examines its logic and limits.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
