/T (The group built a chatbot called CampusBot that answers common student questions about timings, fees, examinations, and contacts. It was written in Python using regular expressions, so that every rule is visible, and it was designed using the same concepts as Dialogflow \(intents, entities, contexts, and a default fallback\) so that it could be rebuilt there. All timings, dates, and fee details in the bot are sample data created for this demonstration and do not describe any real institution.)
/E (The group built a chatbot called CampusBot that answers common student questions about timings, fees, examinations, and contacts. It was written in Python using regular expressions, so that every rule is visible, and it was designed using the same concepts as Dialogflow \(intents, entities, contexts, and a default fallback\) so that it could be rebuilt there. All timings, dates, and fee details in the bot are sample data created for this demonstration and do not describe any real institution.)
