2084 0 obj
<<
/Title (Evaluation used the confusion matrix in Figure 3.2\(b\). Logistic regression classified 28 of the 30 test samples correctly \(93.3 per cent\). All 10 setosa samples were correct. One versicolor was predicted as virginica and one virginica as versicolor, which are the two overlapping species noted in Section 3.3. Precision, recall, and F1 were 1.00 for setosa and 0.90 for each of the other two species. Accuracy alone would hide which class is being confused, which is why the per-class measures are reported as well.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2065 0 R
/Prev 2102 0 R
>>
endobj
